  'local-preview-0c323828535995fc', NULL, 'SINGTEL x SIM AI.DEA (PHASE 1)', NULL, 'Built for senior leaders and decision-makers, this program establishes the strategic clarity required to lead with AI. Participants cut through the hype to identify where AI delivers real business value, how it should align to organisational priorities, and what readiness looks like across people, data, technology, and governance. The course strengthens executive judgement, critical evaluation, and risk-aware decision-making, while grounding leaders in cyber, ethical, and regulatory considerations. By the end of Phase 1, leaders will be positioned to set clear AI ambition, challenge assumptions, and confidently direct secure, high-impact adoption.For enquiries, please reach out to Joan Lim at joanlim@sim.edu.sg',
